onvenient and easy to use, saliva drug test kits can detect up to 8 drug groups and alcohol in saliva with just one test. Browse the range below.<\/p>","link_url":"shopify:\/\/collections\/saliva-drug-test-kits","button_label":"View all saliva drug test kits","color_scheme":"1","button_style":"btn btn--secondary"}},"rich_text_LAmgWB":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"heading_mVfxip":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Urine drug test kits","heading_size":"h5","heading_h1":false}},"text_aceQWx":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Investigate drug use for the past week with urine drug test kits. Tamper-proof and with quick results, the urine drug test cups can detect up to 11 drug groups and alcohol in urine with just one sample.<\/p>","enlarge_text":false}}},"block_order":["heading_mVfxip","text_aceQWx"],"disabled":true,"settings":{"text_position":"justify-start","text_align":"text-start","mob_center_text":false,"color_scheme":"none","full_width":false,"prevent_animation":false}},"featured_collection_RWKMtQ":{"type":"featured-collection","settings":{"title":"","heading_align":"text-start","show_view_all":false,"collection":"urine-drug-test-kits","layout":"carousel","card_size_mobile":"small","card_size":"small","products_to_show":4,"show_promo_info":true,"image_ratio":"natural","promo_title":"Urine drug test kits","content":"<p>Investigate drug use for the past week with urine drug test kits. Tamper-proof and with quick results, the urine drug test cups can detect up to 11 drug groups and alcohol in urine with just one sample.<\/p>","link_url":"shopify:\/\/collections\/urine-drug-test-kits","button_label":"View all urine drug test kits","color_scheme":"1","button_style":"btn btn--secondary"}},"media_with_text_4tdLCF":{"type":"media-with-text","blocks":{"heading_Xp9zfW":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Breathalyser calibration for Adelaide customers","heading_size":"h4","heading_h1":false}},"text_3TFjKT":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>If you're in Adelaide, you can send your breathalyser back to our Melbourne calibration centre.<\/p><p>Our breathalyser calibration process is easy using our online booking system. Simply book a calibration in online, select your desired add-ons such as mouthpieces and batteries, and complete the booking.<br\/><\/p><p>After that, pack your breathalyzer and post it to our Calibration Centre using the postage return label provided in the confirmation email. After the calibration is completed, our technicians in Melbourne will post your breathalyser back to you.<\/p><p>*Andatech Pty Ltd in Melbourne is a NATA-accredited calibration laboratory for breathalysers. <\/p>","enlarge_text":false}},"button_acDfCn":{"type":"button","settings":{"button_label":"Learn more about calibrations","button_link":"https:\/\/andatech.com.au\/collections\/breathalyser-calibrations","button_style":"btn btn--primary"}}},"block_order":["heading_Xp9zfW","text_3TFjKT","button_acDfCn"],"disabled":true,"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Caltrace.jpg","video_external":"","video_description":"","video_autoplay":false,"layout":"left","image_fit":"cover","media_width":50,"media_scale":100,"text_align":"text-start","color_scheme":"1","only_content_color_scheme":true}},"multi_column_wfyfpy":{"type":"multi-column","blocks":{"column_bitGz9":{"type":"column","settings":{"enable_media":false,"media_scale":100,"heading":"Contact Andatech","text":"<p>Contact us if you have any questions about breathalysers.<\/p><p>📞 1300 800 200 or <a href=\"tel:+61388996900\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"tel:+61388996900\">+613 8899 6900<\/a><\/p><p>📅 Mondays to Fridays<\/p><p>🕑 9am to 5:30pm (AEST)<\/p><p><\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":""}},"column_jzBkGt":{"type":"column","disabled":true,"settings":{"enable_media":false,"media_scale":100,"heading":"","text":"<p>📞 1300 800 200 or <a href=\"tel:+61388996900\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"tel:+61388996900\">+613 8899 6900<\/a><\/p><p>📅 Mondays to Fridays<\/p><p>🕑 9am to 5:30pm (AEST)<\/p><p><\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":""}}},"block_order":["column_bitGz9","column_jzBkGt"],"settings":{"title":"","heading_align":"text-start","button_label":"","button_link":"","layout":"grid","column_size":"large","column_align":"left","media_align":"text-center","image_ratio":"natural","color_scheme":"1","button_style":"btn btn--secondary"}},"rich_text_cH7EbP":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"heading_EAaDGA":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Australia's trusted drug testing kits provider","heading_size":"h4","heading_h1":false}},"text_4QjYM6":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Andatech strives to provide the best products and services to all our customers. Below are just some of the drug test kits reviews that we've received from valued customers.<\/p>","enlarge_text":false}}},"block_order":["heading_EAaDGA","text_4QjYM6"],"settings":{"text_position":"justify-center","text_align":"text-center","mob_center_text":true,"color_scheme":"none","full_width":true,"prevent_animation":false}},"testimonials_ThKQNB":{"type":"testimonials","blocks":{"testimonial_HbA8yH":{"type":"testimonial","settings":{"testimonial":"<p>Excellent unit, shipping was fast, ordering was simple. Very rare to find a kit that'll test Oxy, Met, Bar and Ket all at once so this was a gem.<\/p>","author":"- Yalcin C.","author_info":"","show_star_rating":false,"star_rating":5}},"testimonial_ALr6tG":{"type":"testimonial","settings":{"testimonial":"<p>Delivery was fast, items were well packed. The kits were easy to use with clear instructions. Will definitely re-order regularly for our workplace drug and alcohol testing policy.<\/p>","author":"- Victoria G.","author_info":"","show_star_rating":false,"star_rating":5}},"testimonial_RfUrFW":{"type":"testimonial","settings":{"testimonial":"<p>The drug test kits are simple to use and give us a result quickly so we can get the drivers back on the road quickly. <\/p>","author":"- Mark S.","author_info":"","show_star_rating":false,"star_rating":5}},"testimonial_UeKbi8":{"type":"testimonial","settings":{"testimonial":"<p>Easy to use, nice design, clear instructions, fast results.. We love that it can test all the common drugs plus OXY, K2 and alcohol as well..<\/p>","author":"- Germaine W.","author_info":"","show_star_rating":false,"star_rating":5}},"testimonial_mYP7xq":{"type":"testimonial","settings":{"testimonial":"<p>Quick results and accurate tests<\/p>","author":"- Sung L.","author_info":"","show_star_rating":false,"star_rating":5}}},"block_order":["testimonial_HbA8yH","testimonial_ALr6tG","testimonial_RfUrFW","testimonial_UeKbi8","testimonial_mYP7xq"],"settings":{"heading":"","show_quotes":true,"testimonial_size":"h4","text_position":"justify-center","text_align":"text-center justify-center","nav_style":"slideshow_nav_lines","transition":"slide-fade","autoplay":true,"slider_pause":false,"autoplay_speed":5,"color_scheme":"default","full_width":false}},"1712038942887c9cd0":{"type":"apps","blocks":{"judge_me_reviews_featured_carousel_Kc3Lh7":{"type":"shopify:\/\/apps\/judge-me-reviews\/blocks\/featured_carousel\/61ccd3b1-a9f2-4160-9fe9-4fec8413e5d8","settings":{"maxwidth":1080}}},"block_order":["judge_me_reviews_featured_carousel_Kc3Lh7"],"disabled":true,"settings":{"full_width":false}},"article-comments":{"type":"article-comments","disabled":true,"settings":{"comments_per_page":16}},"featured_blog_VTfgFX":{"type":"featured-blog","disabled":true,"settings":{"title":"Read more...","heading_align":"text-start","show_view_all":true,"blog":"resources","layout":"carousel","posts_to_show":3,"show_featured_image":true,"show_tags":false,"show_excerpt":true,"show_author":false,"show_date":true,"show_button":false,"color_scheme":"none","image_ratio":"1.77","button_style":"btn btn--primary"}}},"order":["main","image_banner_jhWkHR","icons_with_text_LTxCzy","rich_text_4ET6LB","rich_text_CN4zLF","logo_list_3fanGC","rich_text_yHVWDc","featured_collection_JBXUxf","rich_text_LAmgWB","featured_collection_RWKMtQ"